WEBVTT

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:54.940
How's the voltage on the batteries?

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:56.980
The left unit's gone below
the rechargeable limit,

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:59.110
so we'll need to exchange it
with a new one right away.

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:02.550
Check the ion exchange filament
in the fuel cell batteries.

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:07.080
25mm on hard point A, power
connection check.

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:08.760
Verify that the gun sight
is properly aligned.

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:11.290
Make sure to do it right after you
check the ammunition feeders.

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:13.200
That's APDS rounds in the right feeder,

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:15.330
and HE rounds in the left
feeder, right, Sir?

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:17.060
Make sure every third one is a tracer.

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.140
Captain Ataka...

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:20.540
Is it the end of my shift already?
Captain Ataka...

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.370
Is it the end of my shift already?

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:23.770
Yes, Ma'am.

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:23.870
How are you, Ma'am?
Yes, Ma'am.

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:25.360
How are you, Ma'am?

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:31.080
Geez, it's amazing how hungry you get
even when you're doing nothing.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.350
Make sure to strengthen the dampers

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:37.990
on the upper arm to match the
kickback from the 25mm.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:41.720
Right feeder is APDS and left
feeder is HE, correct, Sir?

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:42.820
That's right.

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:43.230
Then, I'll set it at plus two
point five on the right,
That's right.

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:45.760
Then, I'll set it at plus two
point five on the right,

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:48.030
and plus one point eight on the left.

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:52.030
You're too kind.

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:53.400
Thank you, Sir.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:53.540
A machine cannon?
Thank you, Sir.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.200
A machine cannon?

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:56.100
That's right.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:56.710
Isn't that a little overkill, Sir?
That's right.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:58.010
Isn't that a little overkill, Sir?

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:01.770
These weapons aren't suited
to putting down a riot.

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.510
Then, Lieutenant Colonel Hirokawa
and the others

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:07.220
expect the US to intervene, and
that's why they have us here?

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.790
No, that's probably not quite it.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:12.590
Hey, are you going to eat that?

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:14.990
You can have it,

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:17.860
but the can of pickled radishes,
I'm keeping.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.100
If it was a question of keeping
US forces out,

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.830
there would be no need to insist
on TA's being on guard.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.400
If a person like Mr. Nishida was
willing to concentrate

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:28.840
so much attention to convince us to
join his cause, that means...

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:32.100
You're not implying that the US
would deploy TA's?!

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:45.250
So, a situation like the one suggested
by Symbol's CEO is in fact plausible?

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:49.420
We live in a time when money rushes
around the globe at the speed of light,

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:52.490
far faster than the pace of the
physical economy.

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:56.200
If Japan liquidates all its overseas
assets at the same time,

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:58.030
the dollar will plummet, and...

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.770
Our economy will be in a shambles.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.270
Is there any way we can prevent that?

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:07.210
It's impossible. We're dealing with dollar
figures too big for us to control.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:10.810
So, this is their retaliation
for our trade policy.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:14.420
But do you think Japan will
really do such a thing?

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:18.690
Japan is being guided by abnormal
passions right now,

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:21.750
passions sharpened like a razor's edge.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.900
In the end, it seems our only option
is to strike against Japan

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.530
before they can start their attack.

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:32.530
The trick is to discover exactly where
the enemy's nerve center is.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:34.800
The Ministry of Finance?

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.410
The Bank of Japan, or the
Tokyo Stock Exchange?

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:39.510
Could it be Ichigaya?

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:42.480
Perhaps Japan is being
controlled from there?

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.550
That's a distinct possibility.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.510
I take it you still haven't been able
to pinpoint where it is?

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.120
We're doing the best we can,
but not yet.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:52.520
Even if we're able to pinpoint where
it is, any military action

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.680
will instigate an international firestorm
of protest against us.

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:59.160
I believe I have found a solution
to that problem.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:01.030
A solution?

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:01.160
We deploy the Fake forces currently
under CIA jurisdiction,
A solution?

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.650
We deploy the Fake forces currently
under CIA jurisdiction,

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:08.130
hiding our involvement in the
process of course.

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:16.240
Thirty-four hours left.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:19.950
The world economy is dependent on
short term investment capital,

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:22.650
nearly all of which is nothing more
than electronic numbers,

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:26.450
and this has led to an excessive
expansion of the global economy.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:29.420
Hot money, the electronic
currency standard,

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.860
capable of moving around the
globe at the speed of light.

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:35.460
Because of its amazing liquidity,
once it starts to balloon,

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.830
it swells tremendously as an
investment instrument.

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.900
But once the bubble bursts, the
depreciation and massive flight

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:43.890
of capital can overwhelm all efforts
to contain the damage.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:47.380
Will America intervene?

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.900
No doubt the US government is
already aware of our efforts.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.020
It's certain that they will strike
militarily in some manner

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:57.890
before the New York Stock
Exchange opens again.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:01.050
Most likely, an attack by
employing TA's.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.320
This will be rerun of the
Bay of Pigs Invasion.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.260
There is no weapon that can match
the effectiveness of TA units

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.700
in enclosed or tight physical
environments

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:12.560
with the exception of other TA units.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:37.620
I've just returned from escorting
Misuzu home.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:40.300
Misuzu?

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:40.400
A TA undergoing repairs at the Lab
reacted to Misuzu's presence.
Misuzu?

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:44.420
A TA undergoing repairs at the Lab
reacted to Misuzu's presence.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:47.090
TA... Mile One...

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:48.940
She can't be!

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:49.300
Well, it looks like there's a possibility
that Misuzu is a kai.
She can't be!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:52.070
Well, it looks like there's a possibility
that Misuzu is a kai.

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:57.210
The TA that reacted to her was
the TA Yushiro used.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.980
Is Misuzu aware of any of this?

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.920
I'm betting that she doesn't know.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:03.820
How about the head of our family?

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:08.760
I'm afraid of what would happen
if he did find out.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:11.020
I haven't said anything.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.200
We conduct the contact
