at Point 00-101.

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:26.540
GS readings?

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:28.640
What was most surprising
was the location.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:32.270
Where do you think Point 00-101 is?

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:35.150
It is where Ichigaya Garrison is located.

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:39.620
What? To conduct an experiment at the
