within the night.

00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:57.980
Data is power.

00:11:58.580 --> 00:11:59.910
Can you understand?

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:02.880
The one with data at his disposal,
obtains all the power it offers.

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:11.930
